{"title": "Blink (Condition)", "pageid": 8582, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Blink_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Has tick type", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blink Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Blink_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Blink_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Blink</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>At the end of each turn, there is a chance the affected entity gets <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinked_to_the_Ethereal_Plane_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinked to the Ethereal Plane (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinked to the Ethereal Plane\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinked_to_the_Ethereal_Plane_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinked to the Ethereal Plane (Condition)\">Blinked to the Ethereal Plane</a>, where it can't be harmed, seen or affected.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>While in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ethereal_Plane\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ethereal Plane\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ethereal_Plane\">Ethereal Plane</a></span>, the entity can't move or interact with anything in the world. It can only choose to teleport up to 6 m (20 ft). When combat ends, so does this effect. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BLINK</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CBLINK%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CBLINK%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_RemoveOnRespec\" title=\"SG RemoveOnRespec\">SG_RemoveOnRespec</a>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: end of turn</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\">Grants:</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dismiss_Blink\" title=\"Dismiss Blink\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Dismiss_Blink_Icon.webp/40px-Dismiss_Blink_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Dismiss_Blink_Icon.webp/60px-Dismiss_Blink_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/Dismiss_Blink_Icon.webp/80px-Dismiss_Blink_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dismiss Blink\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/Dismiss_Blink_Icon.webp/40px-Dismiss_Blink_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/Dismiss_Blink_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dismiss_Blink\" title=\"Dismiss Blink\">Dismiss Blink</a> </dt>\n<dd>Dismiss the effects of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon-wrapper\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 25px; height: 25px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blink\" title=\"Blink\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Blink_Icon.webp/25px-Blink_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Blink_Icon.webp/38px-Blink_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Blink_Icon.webp/50px-Blink_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blink\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Blink_Icon.webp/25px-Blink_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Blink_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-text\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blink\" title=\"Blink\">Blink</a></span> early. </dd>\n</dl></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Blinked_to_the_Ethereal_Plane\">Condition: Blinked to the Ethereal Plane</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinked_to_the_Ethereal_Plane_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinked to the Ethereal Plane (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinked to the Ethereal Plane\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinked_to_the_Ethereal_Plane_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinked to the Ethereal Plane (Condition)\">Blinked to the Ethereal Plane</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity is in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ethereal_Plane\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ethereal Plane\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ethereal_Plane\">Ethereal Plane</a></span>, where it can't be harmed, seen, or affected.</li>\n<li>While in the Ethereal Plane, the entity can't move or interact with anything in the world. It can choose to teleport up to 6 m (20 ft).</li>\n<li>At the end of each turn, there is a chance it reappears in the Material Plane. When combat ends, so does this effect.</li>\n<li>Immune to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\" title=\"Bleeding (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bleeding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\" title=\"Bleeding (Condition)\">Bleeding</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Blink\">Sources of Blink</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch\" title=\"Hoots' Hooch\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cb/ALCH_Mug_of_Beer_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hoots%27_Hooch\" tit